kinase; DGGR = 1,2-o-dilauryl-rac-glycero-3-glutaric
acid-(6’-methylresorufin) ester; SAA = serum amyloid A;
T4 = thyroxine

RI = reference interval; WBCs = white blood cells; NA = not applicable;
HCT = haematocrit; MCV = mean cell volume; MCHC = mean cell haemoglobin
concentration; RDW = red cell distribution width; PCV = packed cell
volume; PP = plasma protein; OSPT = one-stage prothrombin time;
aPTT = activated partial thromboplastin time

RI = reference interval; UPC = urine protein:creatinine ratio;
USG = urine specific gravity; Hb = haemoglobin; WBC = white blood cell;
HPF = high-power field; RBC = red blood cell

